      "id": "flow.mailer-watermill-mail-router",
      "slug": "mailer-watermill-mail-router",
      "name": "Mail Router",
      "summary": "Watermill handler `mail_router` consumes `mail.input` and source control flow branches to `mail.error` or `mail.output`.",
